  "gear": "New Balance Hierro v8 Lichen Green",
  "description": "Sort of. Just scrambled up to the base of the class 5 summit block. Was really tempted to solo the top especially as the rock seemed to get better the higher I went but it wasn’t supposed to be a push-it day in any sense and nobody really knew I was up there. Just sort of poked around the choss up there in the TX3s, I guess in the name of scouting a future summit. Listening to End of August. Hole in my tights. Wore my PCT socks in honor of the approach. Nice alpine day",
